      "modify_from": "When the hand is empty and open at the bin after a release, retreat toward the robot: target [bin_x-0.10, bin_y, 0.20], preserving orientation and keeping open.",
      "modify_to": "When the hand is empty and open at the bin after a release, including a release established using incoming held_color without a sampled separation, retreat toward the robot: target [bin_x-0.10, bin_y, 0.20], preserving orientation and keeping open."
